 fight  them  after drawing the drake away from the  battlefield aero's party launches an  attack with javelin missiles loaded with  oil that once ignited surround the enemy  ships in flames in response dolotea  activates the drake's dragonblood  reactor that surrounds it with a massive  energy field meanwhile on land an  infiltration party hijacks the  drawbridge controls allowing the  kusperchen forces to invade while  gustavo is defeated by edgar with  emery's help back in the sky aero breaks  through the drake's energy shield and  attacks it directly defeating it in a  last effort dolotea takes control of the  drake and attempts to ram it on the base  camp to kill elianora but arrow and kids  stop him taking down the drake for good  after the battle the conspiring forces  take control of the capital and catalina  poisons herself to death to avoid  capture thus ending the war with zalu  decks defeated and elianora recognized  as kusperch's de facto ruler  back to flemish villa the king commends  the order of silva phoenix for their  efforts and awards aeru with his own  laboratory while the airship technology  is spread along the neighbouring  countries ushering a new era of trade  and transportation across the continent  so this is it for today's video if you  like the video give it a huge thumbs up  and subscribe to the channel for more  videos farewell till next time

